          "connectionType": "INTERNET",
          "timeoutInMillis": 30000
        },
        "summary": "Search AI Threads",
        "description": "This endpoint allows users to search for AI Threads within their projects. AI Threads are conversational histories or context bundles where multiple AI Queries are grouped, providing a chat-like context window that tracks prior queries and responses. The search function is designed to help users efficiently locate specific threads based on search terms and other filter options.\n\n### Parameters:\n- **search_term (String!)**: A mandatory field that specifies the term to search for within AI Threads.\n- **from (Int)**: An optional parameter that indicates the starting point in the list of results.\n- **limit (Int)**: An optional parameter to limit the number of results returned.\n- **sort (String)**: Optional. Determines the sorting order of the results.\n- **similarityCutoff (Float)**: Optional. Used to set a cutoff for the similarity score when matching threads.\n- **maxDistance (Float)**: Optional. Specifies the maximum distance to consider in the search.\n\n### Use Case:\nA user may want to retrieve all AI Threads that involve discussions on a specific feature of their software to gain insights or analyze user interactions over time.",
        "checksum": "f9baf8eb0d89ac28829408f20cdee109da7ce0eb7ef572dee6984ab9d8b96e41"
      }
    },
