        "summary": "Search Highlights",
        "description": "This endpoint allows users to search for highlights based on specified search criteria. Highlights are snippets of user feedback extracted from recordings, interviews, app store reviews, or other sources. Using a range of filters and parameters, this endpoint enables users to efficiently locate relevant highlights that meet specific requirements. It supports facets like text search, pagination, sorting, and various aggregations, offering flexibility in how results are retrieved and displayed.",
        "checksum": "e5144bb418916df75c7fb20c5f8b7e61c157e0178e129f7a101132f6a7d1ec27"
      }
