        "summary": "Retrieve AI Threads",
        "description": "This endpoint allows users to retrieve a list of AI Threads within their project. AI Threads are conversational histories or context bundles where multiple AI Queries are grouped together, typically tied to a single user or teamspace. These threads are useful for tracking prior queries and responses, creating a chat-like context window within the application.",
