        "summary": "Create AI Thread",
        "description": "Creates a new AI Thread within a specified project. An AI Thread is a conversational history or context bundle where multiple AI queries are grouped, tied to a single user or teamspace. This endpoint facilitates the creation of a structured thread to track AI queries and their responses, effectively allowing users to manage and review collaborative AI-driven discussions or analyses.\n\nThe `createAiThread` mutation takes the `CreateAiThreadInput` as an argument which includes a name for the thread, access permissions, and optional AI context settings. Once created, this thread can be used to package queries relevant to a particular topic or analysis within the associated project.",
