        "summary": "List Integration Subscriptions",
        "description": "This endpoint retrieves a list of integration subscriptions. An integration subscription is a specific data ingestion task, tied to an Integration, that defines what to import and where. For instance, a Subscription might import all new Zendesk tickets into a specific Teamspace as recordings and highlights. The response includes details such as provider, tenant ID, integration ID, project ID, and status.",
        "checksum": "8c03429275e42aa7c52dc7edd246cec1385ea8326bb89926c33327fb30f6e21b"
