        "x-amazon-apigateway-integration": {
          "payloadFormatVersion": "2.0",
          "type": "aws_proxy",
          "httpMethod": "POST",
          "uri": "arn:aws:apigateway:eu-west-1:lambda:path/2015-03-31/functions/arn:aws:lambda:eu-west-1:888660915533:function:carrot-rest-proxy-freemium/invocations",
          "connectionType": "INTERNET",
          "timeoutInMillis": 30000
        },
        "summary": "Create a new Integration Subscription",
        "description": "This endpoint allows the creation of a new Integration Subscription. An Integration Subscription is a specific data ingestion task linked to an Integration. It defines what data to import and where it should be imported within NEXT. This function is utilized to configure and initiate subscriptions that pull data from third-party integrations, enabling automated and seamless data flows into predefined projects or teamspaces.\n\n### Usage\nUse this endpoint to set up automated data import tasks for applications integrated with NEXT. It is particularly applicable in scenarios where continuous data synchronization is necessary, providing a streamlined mechanism to keep data updated across platforms.\n\n### Input Details\n- **provider**: The name of the third-party service providing the data.\n- **integration_id**: A unique identifier for the integration.\n- **name**: The name to assign to the subscription task.\n- **labels**: Any labels associated with the data or task.\n- **imported_at**: Timestamp for when the data was last imported.\n- **status**: The current status of the subscription task.\n- **data**: Additional configuration data in JSON format.\n\n### Considerations\nEnsure that the integration setup is properly configured and authorized to allow data flow. Regularly monitor the status of the subscriptions to handle any potential issues promptly.\n\n### Example Scenario\nA company uses Zendesk for customer support. They can create an Integration Subscription to automatically import new customer tickets from Zendesk into their NEXT application, ensuring the support teamspace is always up-to-date with the latest inquiries.",
        "checksum": "8a30c477cb66ff11ebe9176081219a63b5d2e62ceaa61388e591fdee78df7d71"
      }
    },
