        "summary": "Retrieve Projects for a Tenant",
        "description": "This endpoint allows you to fetch a list of projects within a specific tenant. The endpoint makes use of a GraphQL function called listProjects, which requires the tenant ID as a mandatory argument. Additionally, you can use a nextToken argument to paginate through results if there are more projects than can be returned in a single response. Each project includes information such as its name, description, access settings, associated members, tags, views, and various AI configurations.",
