        "summary": "Create a New Teamspace",
        "description": "This endpoint allows users to create a new Project, referred to as a Teamspace in the user interface. A Teamspace is a collaborative workspace where users can manage recordings, highlights, playlists, and other resources. The creation of a Teamspace involves specifying details such as name, description, access permissions, member IDs, and optional AI-enhanced instructions for processing insights.\n\nUsers can configure various aspects of the Teamspace, including privacy settings for access and sharing, member roles, and AI customization for automatic tagging and insight generation. The AI settings provide enhanced functionality, enabling users to utilize automated processes and custom instructions for insights extraction and highlight generation.",
