        "description": "This endpoint updates the details of a specific project in the application. The project, known in the user interface as a \"Teamspace,\" is a collaborative workspace used by team members to manage recordings, highlights, and playlists associated with their tasks and objectives. This update function allows you to modify various project properties including its name, description, access control settings, and associated members and tags. It also supports managing AI-related settings such as custom instructions, highlight generation modes, and PII redaction policies.",
