        "summary": "Delete a user",
        "description": "This endpoint deletes a user specified by their unique user ID. It removes the user from the system, ensuring that they no longer have access to any Teamspaces or data within the platform. The operation is typically used when a user leaves an organization or when an account clean-up is necessary. Users in a multi-tenant setup are uniquely identified within their tenant. All associated data with the user, such as highlights or recordings, may also be affected by this deletion.",
