                  "text": "With over 70 million tracks available to stream Spotify's music libraries, vast and diverse users can find anything from the latest hits to classic oldies and even niche genres like K-pop or lo-fi. However, it\u2019s worth noting that some smaller or independent artists may not be available on the platform. Despite this, Spotify\u2019s extensive library is one of its biggest selling points. The sound quality on Spotify can vary depending on the user\u2019s subscription plan and device.",
