        "summary": "Delete a Highlight",
        "description": "This endpoint allows you to delete a specific Highlight by its ID. Highlights are snippets of user feedback extracted from various sources such as recordings, app reviews, or feedback tools. Deleting a highlight will remove it entirely from the system, ensuring it is no longer retrievable or associated with any projects or recordings it was previously linked to. This can be useful for maintaining data integrity and privacy controls within your project teamspace.",
