        "summary": "Update an existing tag in the system.",
        "description": "The `updateTag` endpoint allows users to update details of an existing tag within a project or teamspace. This operation is crucial for maintaining an organized classification system, enabling updates to tag names, colors, and group associations as needed. Tags help categorize insights in recordings and highlights, thus facilitating better filtering, searching, and automated workflows. This endpoint requires the tag ID and optional updates to the tag's name, color, and group. The updated tag information, including timestamp and author of the update, is returned upon a successful operation.",
