          "connectionType": "INTERNET",
          "timeoutInMillis": 30000
        },
        "summary": "Delete a Tag",
        "description": "This endpoint allows users to delete a specific Tag identified by its unique ID within a given project. Tags are used to categorize and manage highlights and recordings, providing an organized structure for user insights. Deleting a Tag will remove it from the system but will not affect the insights or data it was associated with. This operation requires appropriate permissions to ensure data integrity and security within the Teamspace.",
