        "summary": "Delete an AI Query",
        "description": "This endpoint is used to delete an AI Query identified by its unique ID. An AI Query represents a user-issued command that interacts with the AI system to generate insights from highlights. By deleting an AI Query, you effectively remove this interaction and all related data within the system. This action is irreversible and should be done with caution. The endpoint requires the unique ID of the AI Query to be specified in the path parameter `id`. The AI Query returned upon deletion gives the details such as the ID, project ID, thread ID, and other fields relevant to the query.",
        "checksum": "4d3f0a5613e6eb8b7074a7297e9f6956373e2eac73f1262d6d7184011f011314"
