        "summary": "Retrieve a specific AI Prompt Template",
        "description": "This endpoint retrieves the details of an AI Prompt Template specified by its ID. AI Prompt Templates are reusable structures that define how prompts are configured when generating AI output in associated workflows. They are designed for specific contexts indicated by the 'suitable' field, which determines the appropriate scenarios for their use, such as for project-wide queries or specific highlights. The endpoint returns comprehensive details about the prompt template, including its name, description, and applicability context, among other metadata. This can be useful for users who wish to understand or modify existing AI Prompt Structures.",
