        "summary": "Create a new recording",
        "description": "This endpoint allows the user to create a new recording within a specified project (also known as Teamspace). The recording represents a source object from which highlights can be extracted. Recordings can come from various sources such as sales calls, user interviews, support conversations, or reviews. The recording will be transcribed and timestamped, and can be associated with tags and accounts for better organization and retrieval. This process involves providing metadata about the recording, such as title, description, media details, and transcription preferences.",
        "checksum": "12567c94091b0a9616f6049cfb52eb083b6cffaf67a8b605f30739fa10eb44cf"
      }
    },
