        "description": "This endpoint allows users to create an AI Query, triggering a process that generates insights based on provided prompts. The AI Query can be used to sift through Highlights and produce relevant responses to user-issued questions or commands. This process utilizes a predefined AI model and context-based search algorithm to ensure accurate results.",
